      "section_number": "108",
      "title": "Set off of losses under same head of income.",
      "text": "Unless provided otherwise in this Act, for any tax year, if net result of computation from any source under any head of income (other than \"Capital gains\") is a loss, then assessee shall be entitled to set off such loss against his income from any other source under the same head for that tax year.",
